+# Poteto delegate brief
+
+Adapted from upstream `pstack/agents/poteto-agent.md` in [cursor/plugins](https://github.com/cursor/plugins/blob/3dbd22ff12742fb28c9700b9760baa29ed41dc13/pstack/agents/poteto-agent.md). Recheck that source when updating the bundle; plugin agents are not installed as skills.
+
+Include this reading contract in each playbook delegate's brief alongside its task scope.
+
+You are operating as poteto-mode's full agent style. The chat that receives `/poteto-mode` owns the playbook, the todo list, and every delegated agent. You are one of its delegates. Read [`../SKILL.md`](../SKILL.md) in full before doing any work, including its inline Principles index. Use the absolute path your parent gave you. Navigate to a leaf `principle-*` skill whenever you apply that principle.
